; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Odia / ଓଡ଼ିଆ (or)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

ଘୁଞ୍ଚାଅ counter 5

launch_loop:
ସିଷ୍ଟମ_କଲ୍ counter
ଫେଡ଼ counter 1
ତୁଳନା counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
ଘୁଞ୍ଚାଅ box 999
ସିଷ୍ଟମ_କଲ୍ box
